WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.502
-Thank you so much for tuning in
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:04.837
Let's get to the news and jokes.

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:07.306
Well, guys, earlier today,
President Trump called in

00:00:07.306 --> 00:00:09.708
to "Fox and Friends" and
announced that he's gonna start

00:00:09.708 --> 00:00:11.644
coming on the show once a week.

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:13.346
But I think he caught
the hosts by surprise.

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:14.381
Watch this.

00:00:19.551 --> 00:00:20.753
-I haven't heard that.

00:00:20.753 --> 00:00:22.155
-Yeah, Trump announced
that he'll be joining

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:23.890
"Fox and Friends" once a week,

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:25.959
so at least
he's cutting back a bit.

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:27.327
[ Laughter ]
That's right.

00:00:27.327 --> 00:00:30.930
It'll only be one call a week
and 168 hours per call.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.965
[ Laughter ]
"Oh, wow, it's Monday again.

00:00:32.965 --> 00:00:34.334
I got to go.
My --"

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:35.801
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.801 --> 00:00:37.102
I'm not surprised
Fox had to schedule

00:00:37.102 --> 00:00:38.571
a weekly call with Trump.

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:40.873
He's like your relative who
always calls at the worst time.

00:00:40.873 --> 00:00:42.809
"Oh, you're in the shower?
Oh, that's interesting.

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:45.178
I was taking a shower
the other day, and I --"

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:47.947
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:50.216
After the surprise announcement,
Trump was asked about

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:52.986
Bob Woodward and his new book,
and here's what he had to say.

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:01.593
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.593 --> 00:01:03.696
"It was very boring.
None of the pictures popped up,

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:05.465
and nothing I scratched
made a smell."

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:07.466
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.466 --> 00:01:11.904
Yep, Trump claims he read
a 480-page book in one night.

00:01:11.904 --> 00:01:14.173
Please, I have more faith
in there being a real vaccine

00:01:14.173 --> 00:01:15.508
before the election.

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:16.943
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:19.412
I get the feeling Trump read the
front cover and the back cover

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:21.347
and thinks that means
he read the entire book.

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:23.749
"I read it cover to cover."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.749 --> 00:01:25.618
The only way Trump
finished a book in one night

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:29.121
is if he ate it.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.121 --> 00:01:32.024
"Very bland, very boring."

00:01:32.024 --> 00:01:34.227
With the first presidential
debate just two weeks away,

00:01:34.227 --> 00:01:36.328
Trump was asked
how he's preparing for it.

00:01:36.328 --> 00:01:37.864
Here's what he had to say.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:06.526
-So, no, he's not
preparing for the debate.

00:02:06.526 --> 00:02:07.860
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:09.862
Later, Trump was asked about
his repeated suggestion

00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:12.531
that Joe Biden is taking drugs.
Listen to this.

00:02:12.531 --> 00:02:17.504
-You think he's taking some
sort of drugs to pep him up?

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:24.944
-Hmm. Interesting.
Now, remind me,

00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:26.713
which candidate had a chunk
of white stuff

00:02:26.713 --> 00:02:28.381
fly out of their nose last week?

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:31.383
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.383 --> 00:02:34.187
-Ugh!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:35.954
-"That's right.
We're gonna make [sniffs]

00:02:35.954 --> 00:02:38.891
America [sniffs] great [sniffs]
again, again.

00:02:38.891 --> 00:02:40.126
[Sniffs]

00:02:40.126 --> 00:02:41.627
Eventually,
they wrapped things up,

00:02:41.627 --> 00:02:43.529
and Trump was eager to confirm
next week's call,

00:02:43.529 --> 00:02:45.431
but I'm not sure all the hosts
were on the same page.

00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:46.632
Watch this.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:50.537 line:0%
-Then we'll do it every week?
We're gonna do it every week?

00:02:58.544 --> 00:02:59.779 line:0%
-All right.
-Sounds good.

00:02:59.779 --> 00:03:01.814
-Mr. President,
thank you very much.

00:03:01.814 --> 00:03:03.649
You may want
to do it every week,

00:03:03.649 --> 00:03:05.517
but Fox
is not committed to that.

00:03:05.517 --> 00:03:08.053
We're gonna take it
on a case-by-case basis,

00:03:08.053 --> 00:03:11.591
and Joe Biden, as well,
is always welcome to join us

00:03:11.591 --> 00:03:13.926
for 47 minutes, like we just did
with the President.

00:03:13.926 --> 00:03:17.730
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.131
-You know it's been a great chat

00:03:19.131 --> 00:03:20.666
when the person
you're talking to

00:03:20.666 --> 00:03:22.001
says exactly
how many minutes it's been.

00:03:22.001 --> 00:03:23.269
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:25.304
"Well, we've been talking
for 47 minutes, Grandma."

00:03:25.304 --> 00:03:27.773
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.773 --> 00:03:29.675
Well, guys, everyone's
talking about this today.

00:03:29.675 --> 00:03:31.344
Apple held
their big annual event

00:03:31.344 --> 00:03:34.180
and unveiled new versions
of the iPad and iPad Air.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:35.548
Check it out.

00:03:35.548 --> 00:03:39.786
Yep, the iPad Air has
an all-new A14 bionic chip.

00:03:39.786 --> 00:03:41.854
It's really powerful.
To give you an idea,

00:03:41.854 --> 00:03:44.023
it's the same chip
that's powering Mark Zuckerberg.

00:03:44.023 --> 00:03:45.858
[ Laughter ]

00:03:45.858 --> 00:03:47.560
And this is great --
the new iPad's screen

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:49.628
is now sharper than ever before.

00:03:49.628 --> 00:03:51.598
That's right.
Experts say it'll revolutionize

00:03:51.598 --> 00:03:53.399
the way you watch TikToks
on the toilet.

00:03:53.399 --> 00:03:54.900
[ Laughter ]

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:57.069
Apple also introduced
a new Apple Watch.

00:03:57.069 --> 00:03:58.738
Take a look at this.

00:03:58.738 --> 00:04:01.708
Joe Biden was like, "Damn, if
only the numbers were bigger."

00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:04.310
[ Laughter ]

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:06.912
Yep, the Apple Watch is supposed
to make everything super easy

00:04:06.912 --> 00:04:09.949
while you're on the go,
or as Americans in 2020 put it,

00:04:09.949 --> 00:04:11.951
"On the what now?"

00:04:11.951 --> 00:04:13.886
Apple also announced that
they're gonna start offering

00:04:13.886 --> 00:04:15.788
their own fitness classes.

00:04:15.788 --> 00:04:17.190
People were like,
"Yeah, yeah great.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:19.158
Can I still order Domino's
with my watch?"

00:04:19.158 --> 00:04:21.360
[ Laughter ]
This is interesting.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:23.595
I saw that Pepsi is launching
a new kind of beverage.

00:04:23.595 --> 00:04:24.830
Check this out.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:27.733
-Pepsi unveiling its new drink,
called DriftWell,

00:04:27.733 --> 00:04:31.971
with ingredients said to promote
relaxation and ease stress.

00:04:31.971 --> 00:04:33.606
-Yeah.
That sounds way better

00:04:33.606 --> 00:04:34.907
than what I've been doing --

00:04:34.907 --> 00:04:36.542
pouring Nyquil
into my SodaStream.

00:04:36.542 --> 00:04:40.847
[ Laughter ]

00:04:40.847 --> 00:04:43.249
Yeah, the name of the drink
is DriftWell.

00:04:43.249 --> 00:04:44.784
DriftWell doesn't sound
like a drink.

00:04:44.784 --> 00:04:46.285
It sounds like
a retirement community

00:04:46.285 --> 00:04:47.920
where some bad stuff went down.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.054
[ Laughter ]

00:04:49.054 --> 00:04:51.290
I think
I've seen that "Dateline."

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:53.859
And finally, speaking of drinks,
Red Lobster is launching

00:04:53.859 --> 00:04:57.763
a new Mountain Dew cocktail,
called Dew-garita.

00:04:57.763 --> 00:05:00.065
Here it is.
Yeah.

00:05:00.065 --> 00:05:01.467
I don't know.
The Dew-garita sounds like

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:03.469
something you drink
before a colonoscopy.

00:05:03.469 --> 00:05:06.038
[ Laughter ]

00:05:06.038 --> 00:05:08.507
Fun fact -- if you dunk your
Cheddar Bay biscuit

00:05:08.507 --> 00:05:09.675
in your Dew-garita,

00:05:09.675 --> 00:05:12.378
you legally become governor
of West Virginia.

